  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Directly linked to the implementation of the WPS agenda, CARE&apos;s Women Lead in Emergencies (WLiE)
programme is a programmatic approach4 designed to strengthen the full participation of women on
the front line in fragile and unstable contexts, so that they can actively contribute to the design and
implementation of projects in response to the multiple crises that affect them (food insecurity,
forced displacements, violent conflicts, climatic disasters, etc.).</narrative>
  </description>
